    <!--
      Red Wine palette (FR-11): the seed is #7B1E3A, and every other role is a tone of it or of a
      neighbouring hue, so the app stays one colour family instead of an assortment of reds. Light and
      dark are both complete, because the status bar is read in both.

      These are the resource-level copies; the Compose scheme in ui/DuoTheme.kt mirrors them so
      composables and XML never disagree.
    -->
